  "scope": "# Review review-500586a5e3414c8f \u2014 581bb11ff645\nAssignment: `review-500586a5e3414c8f`; original ARC training parent `42a15761`; production v3.0.0.\nScope: **proposed parametric prototype**, plus focused tests/current notes; canonical generator and rule unchanged.\nBuilt: episode-fixed black-cell / 4-neighbor-region counting and ascending / descending sorting, with Racket labels.\nDefault: exact canonical Racket text; all eight normalized canonical pairs replayed successfully.\nChecks: **91 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped**; see `checks/parametric/tests-final.txt` and source-bound history.\nSaved-example replay: **16 episodes, 112 labeled pairs, 64 queries, 448 Racket parameter replays** passed.\nTeaching: each first demo eliminates the seven incorrect declared rivals; query answers never enter inference.\nFixed in the new verifier: boolean/float aliases could pass Python equality; four failing regressions now pass.\nTickets: both completed with one bounded probe each; no new peer safety finding or audit resolution.\nLimits: proposed variants, eight finite rivals, bounded sampling, seed metadata not regenerated; no training admission.\nDisposition: routine task-local prototype intake; no production battery or shared interface change was required.",
